{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "CosmosAI learning export", "elements": [{"id": "title", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 40, "width": 820, "height": 38, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 37001, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 3700101, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786460000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a0", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Milestone 37: Tiny PyTorch Checkpoint Save/Load", "fontSize": 30, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Milestone 37: Tiny PyTorch Checkpoint Save/Load", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "subtitle", "type": "text", "x": 65, "y": 92, "width": 1060, "height": 44, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 37002, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 3700202, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786460000000, "link": "/learn/concepts/", "locked": false, "index": "a1", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Checkpointing saves learned weights to disk so a future process can load them without retraining.", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Checkpointing saves learned weights to disk so a future process can load them without retraining.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "sequence", "type": "text", "x": 70, "y": 170, "width": 1220, "height": 290, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 37003, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 3700303, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786460000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a2", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Checkpoint round-trip sequence\n\nrun_torch_checkpoint_round_trip(sample, trained_model, checkpoint_path)\n  -> save_torch_checkpoint(trained_model, path)\n       torch.save({ model_state_dict, label_to_id, label_count })\n  -> load_torch_checkpoint(path)\n       fresh TinyGalaxyCNN + load_state_dict(saved weights)\n  -> run_torch_forward_pass(sample, trained_model)\n  -> run_torch_forward_pass(sample, loaded_model)\n  -> compare logits and probabilities", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Checkpoint round-trip sequence\n\nrun_torch_checkpoint_round_trip(sample, trained_model, checkpoint_path)\n  -> save_torch_checkpoint(trained_model, path)\n       torch.save({ model_state_dict, label_to_id, label_count })\n  -> load_torch_checkpoint(path)\n       fresh TinyGalaxyCNN + load_state_dict(saved weights)\n  -> run_torch_forward_pass(sample, trained_model)\n  -> run_torch_forward_pass(sample, loaded_model)\n  -> compare logits and probabilities", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "trained", "type": "text", "x": 70, "y": 520, "width": 310, "height": 210, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 37004, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 3700404, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786460000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a3", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Trained model in memory\n\nrun_torch_training_loop()\n\nConcept:\nweights changed during optimizer.step()\n\nProblem:\nif program closes, memory disappears.", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Trained model in memory\n\nrun_torch_training_loop()\n\nConcept:\nweights changed during optimizer.step()\n\nProblem:\nif program closes, memory disappears.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "state-dict", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 520, "width": 310, "height": 210, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 37005, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 3700505, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786460000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a4", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "state_dict checkpoint\n\nsave_torch_checkpoint()\n\nConcept:\nstate_dict = learned tensor dictionary\n\nArchitecture stays in code.\nWeights go to disk.", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "state_dict checkpoint\n\nsave_torch_checkpoint()\n\nConcept:\nstate_dict = learned tensor dictionary\n\nArchitecture stays in code.\nWeights go to disk.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "fresh", "type": "text", "x": 770, "y": 520, "width": 310, "height": 210, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#d0ebff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 37006, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 3700606, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786460000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a5", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Fresh model loads weights\n\nload_torch_checkpoint()\n\nConcept:\nnew TinyGalaxyCNN()\nthen load_state_dict(...)\n\nSame architecture,\nsaved learned weights.", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Fresh model loads weights\n\nload_torch_checkpoint()\n\nConcept:\nnew TinyGalaxyCNN()\nthen load_state_dict(...)\n\nSame architecture,\nsaved learned weights.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "match", "type": "text", "x": 1120, "y": 520, "width": 330, "height": 210, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 37007, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 3700707, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786460000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a6", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Round-trip proof\n\nprint_torch_checkpoint_result()\n\nsaved_predicted_id = 1\nloaded_predicted_id = 1\nlogits_match = True\nprobabilities_match = True", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Round-trip proof\n\nprint_torch_checkpoint_result()\n\nsaved_predicted_id = 1\nloaded_predicted_id = 1\nlogits_match = True\nprobabilities_match = True", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "arrow1", "type": "arrow", "x": 385, "y": 625, "width": 25, "height": 0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 37008, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 3700808, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786460000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a7", "points": [[0, 0], [25, 0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"id": "arrow2", "type": "arrow", "x": 735, "y": 625, "width": 25, "height": 0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 37009, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 3700909, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786460000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a8", "points": [[0, 0], [25, 0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"id": "arrow3", "type": "arrow", "x": 1085, "y": 625, "width": 25, "height": 0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 37010, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 3701010, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786460000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a9", "points": [[0, 0], [25, 0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"id": "boundary", "type": "text", "x": 70, "y": 790, "width": 1000, "height": 170, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f1f3f5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 37011, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 3701111, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786460000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a10", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Boundary\n\nReal now: save/load mechanics and matching predictions.\nNot real yet: useful galaxy model, model registry, API service loading checkpoint.\n\nNext: a tiny inference command can load the checkpoint and predict one sample without retraining.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Boundary\n\nReal now: save/load mechanics and matching predictions.\nNot real yet: useful galaxy model, model registry, API service loading checkpoint.\n\nNext: a tiny inference command can load the checkpoint and predict one sample without retraining.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {}}